<title>USA: Toastmaster Inc Q4 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Toastmaster Inc Q4 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Mo. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(dollars in thousands, except per share)</p>
<p>				   Three Month Results</p>
<p>		For the Quarter ended December 31,</p>
<p>						1996		     1995</p>
<p> Net sales				$54,355		 $64,798</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		    (2,674)		   2,071</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per share	  (.35)		     .27</p>
<p>Weighted average common and common equivalent shares, outstanding (in thousands)</p>
<p>						7,538		   7,548</p>
<p>				   Twelve Month Results</p>
<p>		 For the Period ended December 31,</p>
<p>						1996		     1995</p>
<p> Net sales			     $163,049		$188,509</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		    (4,691)		   1,334</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per share	  (.62)		     .18</p>
<p>Weighted average common and common equivalent shares, outstanding (in thousands)</p>
<p>						7,538		   7,560</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 includes a one-time, after-tax charge of $4.9 million, or $0.65 per share, related to ceasing production at a plant in Boonville, Mo.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
